  "checks": {
    "referenceFidelity": {
      "status": "passed",
      "findings": "Applied the documented research direction: five supporting tentacles in Move, soft elastic weight, focused nonverbal maker gestures, a brief startled Hit and friendly recovery. No extra tail, humanoid torso, spoken acting or angry default. The two raised tentacles remain an upright rest pose choice. Timings are Tower choices, not official GitHub requirements."
    },
    "construction": {
      "status": "passed",
      "findings": "29 deform bones; exact source rest geometry/topology/UV/material/smoothing hashes. Runtime positions and UVs match the static milestone, embedded images and material definitions match, and normal differences stay below 0.0001. Reviewed exposed rear/side/underside bends: connected five-way skin junction, cup rows follow the skin, and the repaired rear/underside face boundary remains black. Correctives use skin triangle attachment and explicit Basis initialization."
    },
    "readability": {
      "status": "passed",
      "findings": "Reviewed the actual Inspector in normal, phone-width, ground/shadow and game-scale views. Focused reach, lowered five-limb walk and surprised recoil read separately; the face remains the dominant contrast cue. The low version retains 3,961 triangles and full cell coverage with three temporary cube fragments, for 3,997 combined triangles."
    },
    "motion": {
      "status": "passed",
      "findings": "Six changing clips at 24 fps. Reviewed starts, anticipation/action extremes, recovery and exact ends; normal playback of several loop cycles and both sides of joins; Idle/Work/Move/Hit selection; Place-to-Idle; replay, seek and unanimated Rest reset. Recovery-foot velocity and acceleration match stance at contact. 240 actual runtime walk samples give <2.73 mm stance gap and <0.006 mm penetration. Independent expression presets vary and reset. Root remains stationary, fitting anchors retain their rest seats and follow assigned bones. Place begins invisible and ends exactly at ready Idle; Resolve ends invisible. Verified deterministic seek, completed hold/replay, loops, phone shadows, effects disabled, phase-preserving reload, exhausted fragment budget and material restoration."
    }
  },
  "secondPass": {
    "status": "passed",
    "findings": "Second author inspection of the final exports after repairing cup binding, exporting armature-driven facial channels, initializing every morph from Basis, and smoothing foot recovery speed. Rechecked focused facial layers and reactions on both meshes; underside/rear/side maximum walk bends; phone/game silhouettes; actual lifecycle endpoints and Rest reset. The Inspector timeline now retains fractional 24 fps endpoints exactly."
  },
